# This is a self-contained DOS / QBasic subproject. Byte-for-byte fidelity
# matters here: core.autocrlf=true is set globally on this machine, and without
# these rules git would rewrite the LF-only .bas/.conf/.bat files to CRLF on
# checkout. That would change their hashes (see ORIGINALS.sha256), and it is a
# needless risk to run anywhere near the DOS binaries.
#
# `-text` disables EOL conversion while still letting git diff the files as
# text, so `git diff` on gorilla.bas stays reviewable line by line.
* -text

# `binary` is shorthand for `-text -diff` -- no conversion, and no attempt to
# render a textual diff.
*.EXE binary
*.exe binary
*.hlp binary
*.png binary
